Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:55.80,Title,0,0,0,0,,《神探飞机头2》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告 目前不见踪影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. No sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.55,0:01:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. I think I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.91,0:02:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可要知道 你能用那个东西弄掉别人的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know… you could put someone's eye out with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.59,0:02:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌 乘客们都救上来了 我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We airlifted out the last passengers, Ace. We're heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不管动物死活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the animal cargo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 不过是浣熊 我若是你 才懒得管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. It's just one little raccoon. If I were you, I'd turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.81,0:02:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是我的话 那我就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were me then I'd be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.43,0:02:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会用你的身体在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd use your body to get to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你阻止不了我 不管你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop me, no matter who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,废物！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,废…物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}L-o-o…s-e-r.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿了吗 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry, fella?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样应该够阻止你一段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ought to hold you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.69,0:03:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别难过 史派克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay, Spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing more we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 史派克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Spike!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not fret, my woodland friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的性命掌握在王牌威龙手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life is in the hands of Ace Ventura…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别号宠物大侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pet Detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you do…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:05:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不要往下看\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧啊 小兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on little buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许没抓住 你在往下滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not. You're slipping!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点被你吓死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was quite a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, um, extremely nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫葛富顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Fulton Greenwall…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.99,0:07:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有人叫做威龙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am looking for an Ace Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,本寺修道者中\N{\fnArial\fs30}No man here…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}carries with him…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}a label.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐姓埋名 早该想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No names. How silly of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个老美\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an American.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.12,0:07:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是造物主共同的子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all children…of the same life force.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.58,0:07:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,额\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有特异功能 会用屁股说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bends over and speaks from his rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.69,0:07:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 原来是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.21,0:07:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请随我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他初来此时精神濒于崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came to us a broken man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全失去了生存的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had lost the will to sustain his existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:08:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我听说过浣熊的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I heard about that unfortunate accident with the raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事件对他是大的打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was terrible for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但造物主\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the life force…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,再度\N{\fnArial\fs30}once again…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,垂幸降怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}smiled upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.39,0:08:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's now…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,心灵恢复了祥和\N{\fnArial\fs30}at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.27,0:08:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite. Well, uh, um, no harm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先自我介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.65,0:08:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫葛富顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Fulton Greenwall,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我想借用阁下长才 协助寻找失踪动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm here to employ your services…in the retrieval of a lost animal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮助我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.56,0:09:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的要求会让我想到你的直肠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your request is like your intestine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇臭难当 而且危险之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stinky and loaded with danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们愿意重金礼聘\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can pay handsomely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是修道之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am now a child of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.97,0:09:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,尘世富贵对我如浮云\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your earthly money holds no appeal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,两万块美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,咳-咳-咳-咳-咳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Re-eh-eh-eh-eh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.81,0:09:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.19,0:09:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}For I am sorely needed…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}here…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,静修\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the ashram.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 插个嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I may interject?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近寺里空间不大够\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're short of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你该善用你的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's important for you to use your talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你打包行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help you pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没达到天人合一的境界\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am yet to attain omnipresent super-galactic oneness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.55,0:09:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你天人合一了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just attained it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就在这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你达到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼神证明了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see it in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你简直超级天人合一\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're more one than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.55,0:10:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,修道成功的奖励呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my medallion of spiritual accomplishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.13,0:10:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你八十年苦修换来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This took you 80 years to achieve!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系反正我现在不想要了 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. I don't like it anymore. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是如此无私无我的奉献\N{\fnArial\fs30}In light of this personal sacrifice you've made…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我不忍继续推辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no choice…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.01,0:10:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定接了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to take the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上告诉大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要好好地跟他们讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break it to them gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没看过他们这么夸张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen them act like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.09,0:11:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然难过 依然强颜欢笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denial can be an ugly thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走了 飞机安排好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go, Mr. Ventura. I've arranged a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.01,0:11:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先到下面等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要办一件很重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still one more thing I must do before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷毙了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't this incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下子肯定会作为一项记录的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be some kind of record!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都喜欢苗条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone loves a Slinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要苗条\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta get a Slinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,苗条 苗条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slinky, Slinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 苗条 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go Slinky go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:12:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,气死人 怎么有这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man!Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然就停在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们快赶不上飞机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, but if we don't hurry, we might miss the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太自私了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How selfish of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我郑重宣告重出江湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do all the things that you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是交配季节的中美洲麋鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canadian moose during mating season.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来模仿的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.68,0:12:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,牦牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}a yak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,牦牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,花生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peanut?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这边有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I have one right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很大 不过我当它随身行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bulky, but I consider it a carryon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要花生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peanuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I see. Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈正事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can get back to business, Mr. Ventura?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦察提部落向来爱好和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wachati are a peaceful tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于族中圣物不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since their sacred animal has vanished…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.40,0:13:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们相信诅咒降临至全族\N{\fnArial\fs30}they believe that there is a curse fallen on their village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生于前一阵子 某个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all started some time ago when, one night…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 瓦察提长的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the daughter of the Wachati chief…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,许配给瓦诸图族的王子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is set to wed the first son of the Wachootoo tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣物将给公主做为嫁妆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the sacred animal was offered as dowry for the marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 若不及时找回圣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it is not recovered…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果将会造成\N{\fnArial\fs30}the result will be…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦察族大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}the merciless slaughter of the Wachati.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Mr. Ventura?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.54,0:13:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机翅膀上\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone on the wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some…thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你刚刚说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, what were you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦察提长的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The daughter of the Wachati chief…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,许配给\N{\fnArial\fs30}is set to wed…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦诸图族的王子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the first son of the Wachootoo tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spectacular!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了大自然之美\N{\fnArial\fs30}This land holds great beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,离犯罪现场还有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far to the crime scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要先带你先到树后面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. I've been instructed to bring you to the consulate…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,领事馆一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is beyond the trees…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.99,0:15:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那片丛林的另一面 所以我们得绕过去 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the other side of the jungle. So we'll have to circle around… Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这方向盘有点松动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steering's a bit loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该调整轮胎定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alignment's off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ventura!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,领事馆到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, there's the consulate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我得找个停车位\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can just find a parking spot…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该开慢一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we should slow down just a teensy bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.30,0:16:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonsense, poopy pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们速度太快了 真的啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going a bit fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,停得恰恰好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.71,0:16:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这车该送去洗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get this baby detailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是总领事的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Consul General's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.92,0:16:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.25,0:17:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,威龙先生 久仰久仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ventura, so looking forward to your arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣 这样打马的屁股 好像也不太痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't seem that painful when you were doing it to the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.18,0:17:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,威龙先生与动物关系极密切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, ha, uh, sir, uh, Mr. Ventura has an affinity for animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走走聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shalln't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Mr. Ventura…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.73,0:17:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有多厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}just how good are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是工作狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a workaholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:18:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近从北非的戈丹回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You recently returned from a trip to Gotan in Northern Africa…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.95,0:18:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且曾经跌个狗吃屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you just took a nasty spill because of some…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.41,0:18:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于工地施工品质不良\N{\fnArial\fs30}shoddy masonry work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.29,0:18:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你怎么知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask how?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.03,0:18:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手上磨痕显示你曾摔下来 高度约三至五英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}The abrasion on your hand is the type sustained in a three-to-five feet fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.96,0:18:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,鞋子上的泥灰显示 水泥工工作时漫不经心恶搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The remnants of plaster on your shoe pointed to a careless mason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.48,0:18:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你那只假表嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your new watch, a quality forgery of Cartier, was…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,八成是从北非黑市买来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}most likely purchased through the North African black market!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.27,0:18:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我的工作态度呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my work habits?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A workaholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你裤子上尿渍只有一小块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urine stain on your pants…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,显示上完厕所只抖一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}would signify that you're a single-shaker man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太忙了 没空多抖几下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far too busy for the follow-up jiggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩服 令人五体投地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant, Mr. Ventura! Simply brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.29,0:18:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢过奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spank you! Spank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和原住民文化\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been coexisting quite nicely with the native cultures…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平共处两百年我们相处形同一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the past 200 years. They're almost like family at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 当务之急是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are they? - It is imperative…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.06,0:19:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,替他们寻回圣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we recover the sacred animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则和平的瓦察提族将遭毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, the peaceable Wachati will be obliterated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.85,0:19:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦诸图族向来好战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wachootoo are bloodthirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们视圣物失踪为耻辱和诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They consider its disappearance both an insult and a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西塞住我牙缝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have something in my teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.78,0:19:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Cadby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,宴会很成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely brunch I must say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎恩来见见王牌威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quinn! I'd like you to meet Ace Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是波顿奎恩先生 他是奎恩野生动物园的老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Burton Quinn. He owns and operates Quinnland Safari Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,请叫我奎恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most call me Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.13,0:19:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁丁 说你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello, Tinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.13,0:19:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会 丁丁 所有鸟类中最聪明的一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure, Tinky. Corvus corax. Common raven. Smartest of all birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,濒临绝种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rare in these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.03,0:20:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的行头实在太惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's quite a wrap you're wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我可以再帮你弄点新鲜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I could get you some fluffy new slippers…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,用无辜的手无寸铁的小海豹头皮做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}made from the heads of innocent and defenseless baby seals!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个无赖是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this ghastly man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.53,0:20:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌威龙 别号宠物大侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace Ventura, pet detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,阁下一定是「大富翁」游戏主角\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be the Monopoly Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.34,0:20:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你让我免费停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the free parking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是一个抗议份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another activist, Maguire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗议份子 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activist, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.81,0:20:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗议分子 是的 呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activist yes heh heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ventura…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,享用大自然的恩赐没什么不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing wrong with enjoying the fruits of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你该试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should try it some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.41,0:20:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alrighty, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.41,0:20:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.91,0:20:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.61,0:21:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「拘票 立刻坐牢」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Do not pass go. Do not collect two hundred dollars."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确不错 不过这太沉重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's lovely, but I fancy myself an autumn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你玩够了 威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've quite finished, Mr. Ventura…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.46,0:21:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以一起前往简报室\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might make for the projection room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.55,0:21:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是希杜 原住民保安队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like you to meet Hitu, chief of tribal security in the province.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,请…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.31,0:21:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.15,0:22:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止没有任何线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this point, we don't have any leads…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.61,0:22:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过类似情况 以前也有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we've had similar problems in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是麦德雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Derrick McCane…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年在本地区出现过数次\N{\fnArial\fs30}spotted several times in the province in the past year. He makes a living…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.47,0:22:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他专门猎捕濒临绝种野生动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}from rare and endangered species.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.68,0:22:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个是澳洲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, these two are Australians.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.31,0:22:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,秃头的叫凯来克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bald one is Mick Katie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.81,0:22:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个听说是原住民抚养大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other is said to have been raised by aborigine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.65,0:22:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,原住民土人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aborigines.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.49,0:22:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,原住民都叫他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The natives call him…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他「卡吉」猎人的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call him Gahjii the hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.12,0:23:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两人以盗猎闻名 有极大的嫌疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both are known poachers and have been seen in the area!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.71,0:23:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼将在四天后举行 我不能坐视杀戮发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wedding's in four days. I cannot have bloodshed here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.83,0:23:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切全靠你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi-ho, Silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.55,0:23:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.56,0:23:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让葛先生同行协助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've assigned Greenwall to assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.57,0:23:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你出发前 威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you go, Mr. Ventura…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.40,0:23:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有东西让你欣赏一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to show you something you may enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我俩都是动物爱好者\N{\fnArial\fs30}As one animal lover to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.43,0:23:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong, Mr. Ventura?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.44,0:24:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.94,0:24:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个可爱的死亡之室\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a lovely room of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.07,0:24:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好保重 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care, now. Bye-bye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.82,0:24:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下 象儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down, Boba!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头壳坏了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ventura, how could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.65,0:24:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌 部落村子就在一里外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Mr. Ventura, I think the village is about a mile ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.48,0:24:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.94,0:24:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆胎啰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flat tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.65,0:24:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,老是这么疯癫癫 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this joke has run its course, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.16,0:24:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.41,0:25:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒犯之处尚请见谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prostrate myself before you and beg forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.68,0:25:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔开开玩笑也不错啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong. I do enjoy the occasional prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.84,0:25:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脚跟走得好痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that my heel is getting rather raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.13,0:25:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们爱你 黑暗大陆晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}We love you, dark continent! Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.18,0:25:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.51,0:25:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是银背猩猩的叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}The majestic song of the male silverback gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.02,0:25:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要赶快走了现在是交配期 它们充满敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should move along. It's their mating season and they can get rather hostile.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.99,0:25:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.37,0:25:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, excuse me, Mr. Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.46,0:25:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.21,0:25:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看也是 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course you do! - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.50,0:25:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦察提族相信他们的力量来源来自洞穴中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wachati believe they draw their power from these caves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.21,0:25:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于圣物蝙蝠失踪 他们陷入一片恐慌之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they live in fear since their sacred bat has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.55,0:25:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.85,0:26:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么 蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}What bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.23,0:26:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是们此行要找的圣物呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one we're here to find, Mr. Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.65,0:26:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你没说那是蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't say anything about a bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.40,0:26:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那有何差别 - 有何差别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the difference? - What's the difference, heh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.24,0:26:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过蝙蝠吗 丑恶无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen one? They're hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.86,0:26:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,目光阴森森的 脚带利爪巨大古怪的翅膀 尖牙利齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lifeless, beady eyes, clawed feet, huge grotesque wings. Even fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.70,0:26:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会传染狂犬病\N{\fnArial\fs30}They give you rabies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.00,0:26:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, quite. I see your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.00,0:26:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是不接这案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But are you saying that you won't take the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.26,0:26:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 身为修道之人我对宇由生命充满了热爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. As a being of light, I must show compassion for all living things of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.26,0:26:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.55,0:26:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我绝不碰那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not touching it, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.72,0:26:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, spank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.45,0:27:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦察提族生性爱好和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wachati are a peaceful people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.95,0:27:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们尊重所有生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}They find all forms of life sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.66,0:27:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢上他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.29,0:27:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.63,0:27:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌威龙 别号物大侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace Ventura, pet detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you this afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.97,0:27:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alrighty, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.97,0:27:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.60,0:27:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的蛋蛋露出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your balls are showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.31,0:27:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,千年来他们仍过着传统生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have lived in the same state for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.98,0:27:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在白人来此之前他们不知疾病为何物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did not know about disease until the white man came.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.66,0:27:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在耍什么宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.95,0:27:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有族内年轻战士必经过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}All young Wachati warriors must face five days…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.50,0:27:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,五天的平衡考验和意志力训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}of balance and concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.12,0:27:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不慎失足掉不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should he lose his focus and fall…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.67,0:27:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得重头再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}he must start over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.13,0:27:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,地震演习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earthquake test!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.72,0:28:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.34,0:28:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,经我琢磨他日必成大器\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my help, he could be the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.47,0:28:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,该去见酋长了 威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should see the chief, Mr. Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.20,0:28:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.58,0:28:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长说他知道你一定会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chief says he knew you would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.30,0:28:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长听不懂你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the chief has not understood the dialect you're using.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.84,0:28:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我很高兴见到他的圣物蝙蝠会及时寻回 请他安啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say I'm happy to meet him. And that his sacred…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.35,0:28:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}bat…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.72,0:28:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,和发现时一样好\N{\fnArial\fs30}is as good as found.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.17,0:29:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 酋长真的喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goodness. The chief really seems to like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.03,0:29:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是瓦察提族表达热情的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a great sign of affection in the Wachati tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.70,0:29:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.05,0:29:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是酋长之子 欧达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is the chief's son, Ouda.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.09,0:29:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,传教士们教过他英文\N{\fnArial\fs30}The missionaries came through and taught him English.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.09,0:29:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.89,0:29:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}My…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.19,0:29:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么那么红\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't I the popular one?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.02,0:29:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到我表示热情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to display my affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们真是水乳交融\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the mucus…that binds us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.31,0:30:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长说圣物供奉之处就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chief says that the sacred hut is over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.61,0:30:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小偷如何闪过守卫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd they pass the guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.28,0:30:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是趁守卫打瞌睡时得手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid he was found shortly after…sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.24,0:30:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍息 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}At ease, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.20,0:30:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「猴」非圣贤 谁能无过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.47,0:30:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭飞鼠竟住得这么气派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite an auspicious dwelling for a filthy, flying weasel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.38,0:30:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Mr. Ventura!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:31:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们的圣地 只有他们族人才能进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is sacred ground. I'm sorry, but only the Wachati are allowed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.36,0:31:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松一点嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.69,0:31:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吐过口水 记得吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the lougie guy, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.14,0:31:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 谢谢你 酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, yes, yes, Chief. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.54,0:31:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长说 除非及时在婚礼之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chief says that unless the sacred bat is returned…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,找回圣物蝙蝠否则瓦察提族将有空前洗劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the marriage of the princess, the Wachati tribe will meet their death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.68,0:31:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的是哪种蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}What type of bat are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.10,0:31:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是那种大型白蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great white bat, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.65,0:31:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,克瑞普索拉种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crepuscular Chiroptera?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.42,0:31:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不过原住民称之为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. But to the natives:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.24,0:31:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「史卡戈」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shikaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.37,0:31:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,史卡戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shikaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.71,0:32:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,史卡戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shikaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.79,0:32:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「史卡沙」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shikasha, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.39,0:32:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「史芝戈巴」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shish kebab.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.92,0:32:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「鲨鲨堡」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shawshank Redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.18,0:32:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「芝加哥」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicago!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.93,0:32:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.85,0:32:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 被淘汰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. You're gone. Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.67,0:32:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you going to eat these?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.03,0:32:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.30,0:32:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去查查那笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to inspect that cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.02,0:33:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, my, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.07,0:33:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这水果盘真是好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fruit paste is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.90,0:33:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,陶碟子也很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pottery is lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.45,0:33:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,用蝙蝠排泄物做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's made from guano.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.03,0:33:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,排泄物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guano?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.57,0:33:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这词我好像听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds so familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.33,0:33:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是蝙蝠大便啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bat droppings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.12,0:33:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦察提族之为大自然资源他们用它制作很多器物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a chief resource of the Wachati. They use it to make things in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.54,0:33:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.19,0:33:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是精采好戏 瓦察族伟大的传统舞蹈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is really fascinating. This is a great Wachati tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.24,0:34:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,处女的诱惑之舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The virgin's dance of seduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.04,0:34:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在遁入空门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am now a holy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.00,0:34:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人对我而言如同大地之母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think of women only as mothers of our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.88,0:34:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们是生命繁衍的圣殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are a sanctuary for the reproductive organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.76,0:34:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类生生不息的神圣象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}A temple to house the miracle of procreation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.14,0:34:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块钱借我当小费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have $1?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.81,0:34:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 我好多年不跳舞啰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much! I've not danced in years!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.42,0:34:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.00,0:34:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.17,0:34:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.26,0:34:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.48,0:35:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到了指纹的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smell the fingerprints of scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.61,0:35:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得进行指纹采样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better dust the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.13,0:35:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一干二净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.01,0:35:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么线索也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not one damn clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.56,0:35:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.27,0:36:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她过来了 不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here she comes. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.61,0:36:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是圣人 我是圣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy, holy, holy, holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.97,0:36:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,心如明镜 莫惹尘埃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thoughts in, bad thoughts out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.81,0:36:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,承蒙你挺身相助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have come to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.28,0:36:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们非常感激你的大恩大德\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in…great appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.03,0:36:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.78,0:36:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,会讲英文\N{\fnArial\fs30}speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.02,0:36:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.87,0:36:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 传教士教我的 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The missionaries came with books. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.79,0:36:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不赖嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are very good with that, heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.17,0:37:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,精确无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's incredibly accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.05,0:37:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Care to try?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.27,0:37:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.14,0:37:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次 肩膀放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try again. Relax your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.60,0:37:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.85,0:37:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再吐气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And release.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.44,0:37:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.07,0:37:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逗得我好开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make me smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.74,0:37:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.41,0:37:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的麻烦仍未解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.58,0:37:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.29,0:37:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸要我嫁的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the man my father wants me to marry…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.04,0:37:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心不知如何取悦他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am worried I will not please him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.22,0:37:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.80,0:37:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没有接触过男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never known a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.06,0:38:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很愿意帮你忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.52,0:38:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you see…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.32,0:38:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,终身要做苦行僧侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have vowed to take a life of celibacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.45,0:38:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.91,0:38:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps this…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.53,0:38:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让你下定决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}will assist your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.84,0:38:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是很诱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.79,0:38:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我是修道之人 心如止水\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am a child of light. A pure spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.63,0:38:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,美色对我毫无影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no longer encumbered by sexual appetites.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.37,0:38:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, mama, oh, mama, oh, mama, oh, mama…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.04,0:38:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 打扰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Mr. Ventura…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.15,0:38:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.37,0:38:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.49,0:38:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,练习念咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}practicing my mantra.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.79,0:38:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 额\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.38,0:39:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是说要去洞穴中看看 - 是呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wanted to visit the sacred caves. - I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.63,0:39:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到外面等我十分钟 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meet me outside in 10 minutes. - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.01,0:39:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我继续完成冥想\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't finish my meditation…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.13,0:39:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我会心神不宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tend to get a little cranky.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.30,0:39:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care, now. Bye-bye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.19,0:39:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,似是柳暗花明又一「洞」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything here seems good! Heh, big load off my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.52,0:39:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,俗话说得好 不入虎穴焉得虎子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can speculate all you want, but unless you check it out yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.57,0:39:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不试你永远不会知道 我们回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never know. Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.91,0:39:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不进去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think you should investigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.87,0:39:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有这个必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason to go in there. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.66,0:39:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭我圣人的直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense it as a holy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.62,0:39:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说你要 - 里面黑漆漆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said you wanted… - It's dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.08,0:39:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会跌得狗吃屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could fall into a precipice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.21,0:39:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个借你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.21,0:39:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 你可真会帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spank you, Helpy Helperton.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.36,0:40:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.99,0:40:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really like it here, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.77,0:40:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}My medallion!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.11,0:40:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will fear no living creature…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.36,0:40:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怕任何妖魔鬼怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as I keep this near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.78,0:41:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃我一记 你这妖魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that, you winged spawn of Satan!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.00,0:41:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.13,0:41:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有火把在手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I really need is my torch.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.05,0:41:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 你这妖鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die, devil bird! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.47,0:41:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.52,0:41:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑到我头发里面了啦在我的头发里面啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in my hair! They're in my hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.99,0:41:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 快救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God in heaven! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.62,0:41:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.12,0:41:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头发里没有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing in your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.00,0:41:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.08,0:41:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在测验你们的警觉性如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was merely running a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.84,0:41:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切正如我怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.13,0:41:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奎恩来过这洞穴 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quinn. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.80,0:41:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在凯比宴会上见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met him at Cadby's soiree.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.80,0:42:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带着一只鸟鸦丁丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}His bird is a raven, Tinky. I found that inside the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.98,0:42:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在洞中找到它羽毛 奎恩这个人势力庞大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. Burton Quinn is a powerful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.75,0:42:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worry not, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.36,0:42:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}For I…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.82,0:42:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个化妆\N{\fnArial\fs30}am a master…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.57,0:42:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}of disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.37,0:43:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们 尽量吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat up, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.08,0:43:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别浪费食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this animal goes to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.04,0:43:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦先生 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.29,0:43:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦德雷 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. McCane.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.79,0:43:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.10,0:43:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,马马虎虎啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.93,0:44:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎恩先生 不用管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh. Don't mind me, Mr. Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.09,0:44:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小犀牛会自得其乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a curious little rhino.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.81,0:44:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate your…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.31,0:44:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十分感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}agreeing to undertake this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.61,0:44:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟和死徒在此碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meeting secretly with sinister types much?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.82,0:44:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人在搞什秘密飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, not too much. Ah, much too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.97,0:44:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在犀牛肚子里可真热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of hot in these rhinos.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.36,0:45:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,热死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.37,0:45:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一条狗 他的名字是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a dog and his name was…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.87,0:45:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.09,0:45:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一点新鲜空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, time to get some oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.01,0:45:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.98,0:45:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.08,0:45:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 要 空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have air!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.13,0:46:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.44,0:46:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 你们快过来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet, quiet, quiet. Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.98,0:46:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.07,0:46:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,母犀牛在生小犀牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mother rhino is giving birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.58,0:46:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.48,0:46:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.32,0:47:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.99,0:47:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.69,0:47:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, get in the jeep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.28,0:47:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 姑娘们 进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick. girls. get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.91,0:47:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临奎恩动物园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Quinnland.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.33,0:47:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 我的老友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you too, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.80,0:47:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会感到宾至如归\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you'll be happy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.80,0:47:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.35,0:47:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么溜出来 小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get out, fella?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.52,0:47:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个坏东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a cute little devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.19,0:47:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.92,0:48:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.42,0:48:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.72,0:48:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.59,0:48:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.09,0:48:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}is…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.72,0:48:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.64,0:48:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来你是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.72,0:48:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在凯比家见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met you at Cadby's!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.06,0:48:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're that…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.40,0:48:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,威龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ventura fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.02,0:48:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.28,0:48:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠到底在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is that darn bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.03,0:48:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么 你要怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you going to do? What're you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.03,0:48:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你招出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever I have to get some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.25,0:48:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.55,0:48:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.42,0:48:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我停下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd like me to stop it, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.80,0:48:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这声音好听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.63,0:48:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也不会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I won't tell you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.64,0:49:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.02,0:49:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱充英雄 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tough guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.19,0:49:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么对待英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what to do with tough guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.20,0:49:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥最喜欢跟我来这一招\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother used to do that to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.33,0:49:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个变态的混蛋 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sadistic bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.26,0:49:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.63,0:49:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我老实招\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! I'll talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.42,0:49:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快说 - 我付钱给 麦德雷 请他找那蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spill it! - I paid Derrick McCane to find the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.97,0:49:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,以便吸引观光客来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it could be an attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.31,0:49:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这阵子生意不大好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Business has been a bit off lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.56,0:49:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.19,0:49:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't know who…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.81,0:49:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蝙蝠的下落 - 麦德雷 也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- took the bat? - Neither does McCane.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.32,0:49:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.20,0:50:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就放了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to untie you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.41,0:50:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你了解 我是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I do, I want you to know that I'm really…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.08,0:50:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到\N{\fnArial\fs30}truly…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.54,0:50:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常\N{\fnArial\fs30}very…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.79,0:50:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.51,0:50:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你让我搭便车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate the lift!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.55,0:50:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会自己走回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll walk from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.31,0:50:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎恩没有嫌疑 这下子线索又断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quinn is out of the picture. We have no more suspects or clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.73,0:50:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我有第六感\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have instincts back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.35,0:50:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,直觉告诉我就快找到嫌犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my instincts tell me we're getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.52,0:50:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.19,0:50:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到了 就在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it like it's right…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.53,0:50:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.99,0:50:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.16,0:50:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,脖子开始麻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting to get numb!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.76,0:50:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,中了三箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three darts…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.25,0:50:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像太多啰\N{\fnArial\fs30}is too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.75,0:51:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概躲过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I lost them!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.58,0:52:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这花是给我的花吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flowers…for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.50,0:52:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,白瑞德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do declare, Mr. Beauregard.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.29,0:52:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.09,0:52:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was I…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.30,0:52:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说梦话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}talking in my sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.93,0:52:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直处于歇斯底里状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been suffering hysteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.07,0:52:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,典型的中毒后自然反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a natural reaction to the poison in these darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.31,0:52:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.11,0:52:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,排泄物做的碗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guano bowls.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.07,0:52:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好可以配一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collect the whole set.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.61,0:52:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌 你看楚是谁偷袭的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace, did you see the shooter?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.33,0:52:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只看到脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only their feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.95,0:52:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,证据不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough for a positive ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.16,0:52:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是瓦诸巫师的毒箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the dart of a Wachootoo shaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.33,0:52:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The what-y what-an?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.71,0:52:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦诸图族的巫师他对落这次通婚极为反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wachootoo shaman, or medicine man, protests the intertribal wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.84,0:53:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.47,0:53:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会说瓦诸图语\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not speak Wachootoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.47,0:53:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.23,0:53:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧达会替我翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouda will be my interpreter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.01,0:53:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.94,0:53:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要小心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.25,0:53:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是野蛮人 落到他们手你会凶多吉少\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wachootoo are savages. If they catch you, they'll be merciless.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.45,0:53:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要担心 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worry not that brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.53,0:53:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将会是墙上的一只苍蝇 海里的一粒盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be as a fly on the wall. a grain of salt in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.41,0:53:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将会穿梭在他们中间 犹如透明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will slip amongst them like a transparent…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.00,0:53:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.44,0:54:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠一定在那茅屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sacred bat must be in a hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.61,0:54:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得想法子混进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never know until I can walk freely among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.49,0:54:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wunderbar!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.41,0:54:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个绝好的点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He exclaimed with great relish.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.48,0:54:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 女孩们 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girls, show them what you got. Unh!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.02,0:54:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.12,0:55:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.46,0:55:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧达应该会带救兵来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouda is probably going for help right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.30,0:55:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.42,0:55:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们逮到我了 不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found me! No sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.59,0:55:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不用自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't beat yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.19,0:55:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.86,0:55:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,口香糖是引起蛀牙最主要原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}gingivitis is the number one cause of all tooth decay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.82,0:55:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,「依昆苏欧查」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does "equinsu ocha" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.49,0:55:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,白色的魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}White devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.58,0:55:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉他我不是 - 我刚认识你 怎知你是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell him I'm not. - I only met you. How do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.84,0:55:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说 - 我猜猜看「白色魔鬼」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He said… - Let me guess."White devil"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.43,0:55:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了 你会瓦诸图语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. You speak Wachootoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.88,0:55:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你替我翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them what I'm saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.22,0:55:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为了和平前来此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.19,0:56:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到你说「依昆苏欧查」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't help but notice the "equinsu ocha" part.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.94,0:56:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,连你也说我是白色魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you refer to me as "White Devil"?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.98,0:56:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说你是 你就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how they know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.53,0:56:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,先撇开这话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave that part out from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.70,0:56:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表公主前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I represent the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.13,0:56:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争如同地狱般\N{\fnArial\fs30}War is hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.34,0:56:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不愿轻易\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing we want…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.05,0:56:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.52,0:56:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chief said…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.78,0:56:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你通过他们的考验\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you pass all Wachootoo tests…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.32,0:56:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就饶你不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do not die.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.53,0:56:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.10,0:58:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于进入了决赛圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. My entrance to the winner's circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.63,0:58:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我赢得各位尊敬但我不过是个小人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your admiration is well-founded, but I'm merely a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.51,0:58:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别太崇拜我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not worship me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.02,0:58:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长说这是最后一关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief says you have passed all tests but one.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.57,0:58:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦诸图的死亡决赛圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only left is Wachootoo Circle of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.11,0:58:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.57,0:58:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我最厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.90,0:59:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这傢伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.44,0:59:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.50,0:59:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alrighty, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.84,0:59:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must tell you…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.76,1:00:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我一点也不想打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wish to fight you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.35,1:00:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的我不再滥用暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violence is no longer in my nature…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.89,1:00:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过若你坚持 我也奉陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you want it, you got it, sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.44,1:00:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在咬我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biting, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.44,1:00:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒还不知道瓦诸图族\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was unaware that the Wachootoo…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.28,1:00:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟会乱咬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}were biters!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.45,1:00:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怕死就再试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you try this on and see how it fits?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.69,1:00:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.96,1:00:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的武功比你厉害多\N{\fnArial\fs30}He much better fighter than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.34,1:00:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.65,1:00:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.32,1:00:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,白色魔鬼这件事情已经扯得太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This White Devil thing has gone far enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.48,1:01:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.94,1:01:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有胆子弄乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}messes…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.70,1:01:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the "do"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.63,1:01:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 抱歉 白色魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, sorry, White Devil…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.14,1:01:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he must kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.51,1:01:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你 我猫一样的身手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have you know I have the reflexes of a cat.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.14,1:01:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,和猫鼬一般的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the speed of a mongoose.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.94,1:01:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.35,1:01:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有种就上呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dare you!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.66,1:01:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧达 别傻傻站着丢枝矛过来给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouda, don't just stand there. Throw me a spear!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.32,1:02:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛死我了 刺到骨头里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the bone! It's in the bone!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.24,1:02:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺到骨头里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the bone!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.59,1:02:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你让他们笑得半死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says you make him laugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.68,1:02:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你简直像个娘儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are like sissy girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.24,1:03:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,娘儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}sissy girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.11,1:03:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,酋长说 你现在是瓦诸图之友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wachootoo Chief say, "You friend to Wachootoo."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.00,1:03:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过若明天日正当中时 史卡戈仍未寻回的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if the curse of Shikaka not lifted by tomorrow's sun at top of sky…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.46,1:03:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要血洗瓦察提族而且会砸烂你的大头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wachootoo kill all Wachati and smash your head on a rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.39,1:03:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.80,1:03:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重 再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care now. Bye-bye then.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.93,1:03:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care, now. Super. Bye-bye, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.48,1:03:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的腿会痛吗 要我背你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are your legs sore? Want me to carry you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.77,1:03:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't be necessary, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.77,1:03:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能忍得住痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a high pain threshold.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.66,1:03:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, holy monkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.47,1:04:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace, why you stopped?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.35,1:04:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦诸图族没有偷走那蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wachootoo didn't take Shikaka.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.98,1:04:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.48,1:04:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能说出这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you say this is?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.15,1:04:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是瓦诸图巫师的毒箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dart of Wachootoo shaman.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.24,1:04:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 和我第一次中的毒箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely. And when compared to one of the darts…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.26,1:04:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来比较 - 一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that hit me before? - Same.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.03,1:04:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这笨蛋当然看不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to the untrained eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.29,1:04:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦诸毒液来自含羞草系植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wachootoo dart is made of wood from a mimosa tree…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.54,1:04:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这个是红蕈系植物毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the other is carved from a red fungus-bearing acalla.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.21,1:04:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,丛林区只有一处有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's only one area of the jungle with red…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.21,1:04:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,红蕈类植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}fungus-bearing acallas.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.38,1:04:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快回村子通知他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to the village.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.38,1:04:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦诸图族正午时会发动攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them the Wachootoo attack tomorrow at noon.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.29,1:04:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.06,1:05:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情快水落石出\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little hound dog just picked up a scent.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.57,1:05:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't be long now, Katie.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.62,1:05:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚是个大日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big night tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.71,1:05:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上会见到你的新主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to meet your new owner.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.67,1:05:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,高兴吧 恶心的鼠辈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day. Disgusting rat!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.85,1:05:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来事情易如反掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gravy!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.86,1:05:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.61,1:05:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 银背猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Silverback.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.67,1:06:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是只母的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Female.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.17,1:06:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且很大 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Big. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.05,1:06:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,约在两百码外\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 200 meters…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.63,1:06:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们南方\N{\fnArial\fs30}south.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.80,1:06:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只大约值美金五千元\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd get $5000 for one of those.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.60,1:06:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这只鼠辈怎么办 - 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the rat? - Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.35,1:06:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back in no time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.36,1:06:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让它注意到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay downwind of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.75,1:06:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这傢伙比我想像还要丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're even uglier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.67,1:06:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可算是庞然大物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a big one, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.19,1:07:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.78,1:07:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,河畔杨柳青青\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deciduous trees on the bank.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.36,1:07:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,风光无限美妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suman shrubs with extreme protococcus.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.57,1:07:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上湍湍急流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steadily increasing water current.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.74,1:07:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,史派克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spike…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.03,1:07:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能会越来越惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we could assume the stream gets pretty rough up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.88,1:07:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先替你松绑 你再替我咬断\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I get you loose, you can chew through my ropes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.72,1:07:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.39,1:07:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.32,1:07:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.21,1:08:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,史派克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spike…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.35,1:08:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,史派克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spike!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.11,1:08:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.66,1:08:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.31,1:09:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧 快投降吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "uncle"! Say "uncle"!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.56,1:09:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑没种就别惹我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't start what you can't finish!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.52,1:09:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,认输吧 认输吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit hitting yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.78,1:09:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,河水味道不赖嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, water tastes good, yes! Glub, glub.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.83,1:09:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是想不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.79,1:09:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有什么疏忽线索 动机 一定漏掉了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I missed. Some clue or motive I've overlooked.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.08,1:09:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于动机嘛 应该是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that motive is…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.67,1:09:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}plah!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.26,1:09:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快用力想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.67,1:09:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人故意挑起战端\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone wants the tribes to destroy each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.09,1:09:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,两族杀伐 以便渔翁得利\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be something valuable in this equation.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.10,1:09:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我得进行冥想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we should meditate, Spike.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.43,1:09:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,古有名训 定而后能安\N{\fnArial\fs30}For it is said that when seeking answers, one must…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.42,1:09:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,安而复能虑 虑而后能得\N{\fnArial\fs30}quiet the soul in order to hear them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.61,1:10:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦察提族中之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it the Wachati possess…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.15,1:10:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了公主那对大咪咪外\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is of great value to other men…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.57,1:10:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么会使人垂涎的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}besides the princess with the amazing rack?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.92,1:10:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alrighty then.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.47,1:11:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.38,1:11:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌 你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're back?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.30,1:11:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,万事通 给点小道消息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can dispense with the smallpox, all-knowing one.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.31,1:11:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,事关紧急不容搁 废说少说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here on business, and time is of the essence.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.81,1:11:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.52,1:11:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What answer do you seek?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.48,1:11:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦察提族中之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do the Wachati possess…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.19,1:11:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,何者对文明人类具有重大价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is of great value to civilized man?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.03,1:11:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,护身符会引导你找出答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}The medallion will lead you to the answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.33,1:11:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,护身符还在你身上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do still have the medallion, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.66,1:11:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么护身符 喔 了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medallion? Why, surely.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.42,1:11:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过它目前与我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left it back, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.46,1:11:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉身同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my body.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.00,1:11:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,少打屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your aura…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.01,1:11:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧你心虚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is weakening.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.30,1:11:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 我扔在洞穴里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! I threw it in a cave!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.01,1:11:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要怎样 难道你没掉过东西吗 圣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from me? What are you? Mr. Perfect?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.81,1:11:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道护身符在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.31,1:11:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,它大概被\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably lying…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.48,1:12:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢在一堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a big pile of…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.58,1:12:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,排泄物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guano!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.25,1:12:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have guano!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.14,1:12:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.14,1:12:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}a glove.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.44,1:12:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Chief!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.56,1:12:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你来迎接我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate your meeting me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.94,1:12:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go kick some…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.40,1:12:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,会给总领事难看\N{\fnArial\fs30}consulate butt.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.50,1:13:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰 王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.92,1:13:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回来领赏吗 - 答错你这变态魔王\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want your money? - Wrong again, Sweeney Toad.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.71,1:13:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找回那圣物蝙蝠 在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come for the sacred bat. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.84,1:13:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, whatever can you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.01,1:13:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,排泄物啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guano!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.51,1:13:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿呆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.89,1:13:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大便 听懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does poop ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.19,1:13:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物排泄物是大自然肥料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guano mines as a source of nitrate…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.77,1:13:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,占全世界肥料百分之八十四\N{\fnArial\fs30}producing 84 percent of the world's fertilizer…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.52,1:13:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,毎年产值约美金十四亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}a $1.4-Billion industry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.23,1:13:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是战争起因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this war is about.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.78,1:13:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于蝙蝠洞属于瓦察图族让你无法据为己有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't take possession of the caves while the Wachati inhabit the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.70,1:13:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那些大便\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want that dookie so bad…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.12,1:13:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你垂涎三尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can taste it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.70,1:13:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.04,1:13:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 谢谢你 老葛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you, Fulton.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.71,1:13:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很会编故事 威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a fine theory, Mr. Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.21,1:13:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟这件事有何牵连\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it got to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.88,1:13:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.05,1:13:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会问了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}never ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.56,1:14:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我初见你时注意你鞋上有白点\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I met you, there was a white substance on your shoe.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.39,1:14:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天我发现同样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, I saw the same substance outside the hut…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.15,1:14:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想到白蝙蝠大便是白色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it hit me that the Great White Bat has white guano.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.40,1:14:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你跌跤的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you slipped in! That's what was on your shoe!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.24,1:14:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手上的伤就是这么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that explains the abrasion on your palm!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.82,1:14:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒带一遍 仔细看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me run that back for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.41,1:14:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这么摔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you slipped in! That's what was on your shoe!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.33,1:14:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,手上的伤是这么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that explains the abrasion on your palm!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.59,1:14:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么那么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, I'm good!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.59,1:14:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有同感吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.80,1:14:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗 阿呆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel it, Captain Compost?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.72,1:14:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,末日降临了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day of redemption is at hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.14,1:14:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快忏悔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repent!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.60,1:14:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,信我者得永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thou shall be saved.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.77,1:14:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害厉害果然是高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.53,1:14:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这案子被你破解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you've solved the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.82,1:15:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我倒是还想不通 柏瓦蒂尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing I still don't understand, Mr. Belvedere.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.33,1:15:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你是卑鄙无耻下流的主谋者\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are the slime behind this little flim-flam…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.75,1:15:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 哦 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}why, oh, why…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.50,1:15:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要雇用我办案\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you hire me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.54,1:15:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了日后法律调查时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid there'll be an investigation after the war.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.88,1:15:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以替我作证脱罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were my alibi…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.30,1:15:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明我有尽全力阻止战争发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}to prove I'd done everything I could to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.55,1:15:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrest him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.39,1:15:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrest him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.39,1:15:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把他抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please arrest him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.64,1:15:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师说 抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon says, "Arrest him."
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.82,1:15:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为任何动物你都喜欢 威龙先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you loved all animals, Mr. Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.17,1:15:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把他钉在墙上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I stick him on the wall?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.71,1:15:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看免了 卡吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh, no, I don't think it'll be necessary, Gahjii.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.46,1:15:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,威龙先生盗走了圣物蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ventura has very cleverly stolen the sacred bat of the Wachati.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.88,1:16:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 我们未能及时寻回无法阻止战争发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, we were unable to recover it in time to stop the war.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.85,1:16:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把灯关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the lights!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.06,1:16:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,开关在你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The switch is on the wall beside you! Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.53,1:16:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flick it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.12,1:16:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好耶 我们坐牢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alrighty, then. Shall we go to jail?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.02,1:16:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛 黑魔王啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you? H.R. Shove-n-Stuff?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.10,1:16:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.81,1:16:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.23,1:16:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.66,1:17:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 快停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! I said, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.42,1:17:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,象儿 我们搬救兵去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the jungle, Boba!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.94,1:17:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,战友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.44,1:17:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位丛林弟兄们\N{\fnArial\fs30}rodents…quadrupeds.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.73,1:17:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lend me your ears!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.33,1:17:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这白痴 竟然让他给跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imbecile! You let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.70,1:17:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道对部落屠杀毫不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't seem to understand. The tribe will be killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.75,1:17:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得提醒我寄致悼卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me to send a sympathy card.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.96,1:17:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那混蛋跑不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to get the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.79,1:18:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在什么办法也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing he can do now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.92,1:18:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠在我们手上 又近中午\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got the bat, and it's nearly noon.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.19,1:18:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面怎么一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.15,1:19:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.45,1:19:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,人与动物如此和谐共存\N{\fnArial\fs30}humans and animals can live in harmony!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.29,1:19:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.96,1:19:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌 抱歉来迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for the delay, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.18,1:19:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 动物大盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, poachers!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.64,1:19:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这臭小子打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello to my stinky little friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.91,1:19:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.91,1:20:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么简单让你溜掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so fast, Sally!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.54,1:20:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿开啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it away!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.72,1:21:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这傢伙想甩掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, he wants to go off-road.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.82,1:21:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.07,1:21:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不跟人家玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wants to play with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.54,1:21:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loser!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.93,1:21:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在领事馆见过嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the consulate, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.73,1:21:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.79,1:22:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,中午了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noon.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.63,1:22:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦察提族\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wachati.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.51,1:23:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,意志力克服心理障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spirit will overcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.05,1:23:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎头族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headhunters!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.91,1:24:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,史卡戈来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shikaka!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.26,1:24:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过 大家让路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through. Clear a path, people!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.06,1:25:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他俩将在族人面前行周公之礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will now consummate the marriage as the tribe watches.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.86,1:26:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌 干得好 你一定感到很骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Ace. You must be extremely proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.11,1:26:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,骄傲徒然令人嫌恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pride is an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.03,1:26:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,修道之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One must forego the self…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.86,1:26:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,需以无我进行灵修\N{\fnArial\fs30}to attain spiritual creaminess…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.99,1:26:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,方能避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}and avoid the chewy chunks…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.95,1:26:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,自我之堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}of degradation.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.96,1:26:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说什么 - 我想他说的是 她不是处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that he's he saying? - I think he's saying, "She's not a virgin."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.89,1:26:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们连这个也看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can tell that?
